        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu Mwĩaĩi, Yeova wa nguthu, Ũla Mwene Vinya wa Isilaeli, easya, A! Nĩngwĩvathana na nthũ syakwa, na kwĩĩvanĩsya kwa amaitha makwa; ",
          "type": "text",
